## 📝 To Do

#### Before you move on take a minute to learn about barriers in Internet access.

* #### Learn more about challenges in Internet access by exploring <a href='https://studio.code.org/courses/artificial-intelligence-foundations-v2-2025/units/4/lessons/7/levels/1' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;'>data from the Pew Research Center</a>. Click continue as you read through the levels learn about Internet use over time, home broadband use by income, Internet use by age, and more. This content is covered in Lesson 7: The Internet's Hidden Barriers.

* #### Learn more communities affected by Internet access by exploring the <a href='https://docs.google.com/document/d/1yn_Z-uroLVk7Lo5-wp9BjonpRRjnnliIUmGpoRv_2Ls/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.5ychaexmv4p8' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;'>Persona Fact Sheets</a> from Day 1 of the Internet Access Advocacy Campaign Project. You can also interact with each of these personas using an <a href='https://studio.code.org/courses/artificial-intelligence-foundations-v2-2025/units/4/lessons/7/levels/6' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;'>AI Chatbot</a> from Lesson 7: The Internet's Hidden Barriers.

